  "statement": "The requirements I advocate for are crucial for enhancing the sustainability of the ATM system. GRN-01 aims to minimize energy consumption through optimized transaction processing, while GRN-02 ensures transparency by providing a carbon footprint report for each transaction, encouraging environmentally conscious behavior. GRN-03 promotes the use of energy-efficient hardware, reducing the overall ecological impact. GRN-04 focuses on efficient data logging to save storage resources, and GRN-05 supports a paperless approach by offering electronic transaction records. GRN-06 helps conserve energy by shutting down during inactivity, and GRN-07 ensures that the environmental impact is regularly assessed and reported.",
